---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact - Fictional History Archive">
  <div class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-dashed border-archive-border pb-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4">Secure Transmission Channel</h2>
    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-archive-muted">Establish an encrypted link to the Archive's ingestion team.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    <article class="prose prose-invert prose-archive font-serif leading-relaxed text-archive-paper">
      <p>
        Have you discovered an anomalous artifact? Witnessed a timeline shift? The Archive relies on field agents and civilian reports to expand our records of multiversal events.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please use the adjacent terminal interface to submit your report. Ensure all chronometric data is accurate before transmission.
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg mt-6 mb-2">Emergency Protocols</h3>
      <p class="text-sm">
        If you are currently experiencing a paradox cascade or your reality is undergoing active erasure, do not use this form. Initiate Protocol Omega via your standard-issue temporal tether immediately.
      </p>
    </article>

    <div class="bg-archive-surface border border-archive-border p-6 font-sans">
      <div class="mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-archive-border">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-archive-terminal">Terminal_ID: 884-A</p>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-archive-terminal">Encryption: Active (Quantum-Resistant)</p>
      </div>

      <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
        <div>
          <label for="agent-id" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-archive-muted mb-1">Agent ID / Name <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-archive-accent ml-1">*</span></label>
          <input
            required
            type="text"
            id="agent-id"
            name="agent-id"
            class="w-full bg-archive-bg border border-archive-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-archive-paper focus:outline-none focus:border-archive-accent focus:ring-1 focus:ring-archive-accent"
            placeholder="Classified"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="timeline" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-archive-muted mb-1">Origin Timeline Designation <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-archive-accent ml-1">*</span></label>
          <input
            required
            type="text"
            id="timeline"
            name="timeline"
            class="w-full bg-archive-bg border border-archive-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-archive-paper focus:outline-none focus:border-archive-accent focus:ring-1 focus:ring-archive-accent"
            placeholder="e.g., Earth-616, Timeline Beta"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="report" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-archive-muted mb-1">Anomaly Report <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-archive-accent ml-1">*</span></label>
          <textarea
            required
            id="report"
            name="report"
            rows="5"
            class="w-full bg-archive-bg border border-archive-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-archive-paper focus:outline-none focus:border-archive-accent focus:ring-1 focus:ring-archive-accent"
            placeholder="Describe the historical deviation..."
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="w-full bg-archive-accent text-archive-bg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest py-3 px-4 rounded hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-opacity mt-4"
        >
          Transmit Data
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
